{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06494","headline":"野田黄雀行 · 储光羲","name":"野田黄雀行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啧啧野田雀，不知躯体微。\n闲穿深蒿里，争食复争飞。\n穷老一颓舍，枣多桑树稀。\n无枣犹可食，无桑何以衣。\n萧条空仓暮，相引时来归。\n斜路岂不捷，渚田岂不肥。\n水长路且坏，恻恻与心违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06494.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06494","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}